# Magma-8B x SimplerEnv (simpler-env/SimplerEnv + Magma's tools/simplerenv-magma plugin) venv, Python 3.10, x86_64.
# Compile (no install needed): uv pip compile assets/simpler/magma-requirements.in \
#   --python-version 3.10 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 -o assets/simpler/magma-requirements.txt
# The template installs the lock, then SimplerEnv and its ManiSkill2_real2sim submodule with --no-deps.
# Model stack: microsoft/Magma pyproject.toml @e3737803 (torch 2.3.1, accelerate 0.34.2, timm 0.9.12, einops 0.6.1,
# flash-attn: magma_model.py loads with attn_implementation="flash_attention_2"). The Magma-8B model card says the
# customised transformers fork is required (ConvNeXt `gamma` keys); dev/jwyang-v4.48.2 = 1708d3ca.
